# ============================================================
# Stockix PMS — End-to-end HTTP Test Scenarios
# ============================================================
# Tool:  VS Code REST Client  (or Insomnia / Postman import)
# Run:   Each ### block is one request. Execute top-to-bottom.
#        Copy UUIDs from responses into the @variables below.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   pnpm dev   (services/pms on :3003, apps/api on :4000)
#   Or set PMS_DIRECT=true to hit :3003 directly.
#
# Auth: Direct PMS mode uses x-stockix-internal-secret + x-stockix-tenant-id.
#       Via control API uses Bearer PLATFORM_API_SECRET.
# ============================================================

# ── Variables — fill these in or copy from responses ──────────────────────────
@pmsUrl        = http://localhost:3003
@apiUrl        = http://localhost:4000
@secret        = changeme-dev
@tenantId      = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099
@otherTenantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000098

# Populated by earlier requests (copy-paste from response):
@propertyId   = FILL_FROM_RESPONSE
@roomId       = FILL_FROM_RESPONSE
@guestId      = FILL_FROM_RESPONSE
@bookingId    = FILL_FROM_RESPONSE
@channelId    = FILL_FROM_RESPONSE
@exportToken  = FILL_FROM_RESPONSE
@shareToken   = FILL_FROM_RESPONSE
@templateId   = FILL_FROM_RESPONSE
@staffId      = FILL_FROM_RESPONSE
@inviteToken  = FILL_FROM_RESPONSE

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 0. HEALTH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 0.1 PMS health check — expect { status: "ok", service: "pms" }
GET {{pmsUrl}}/health

### 0.2 Via control API — expect { status: "ok" }
GET {{apiUrl}}/pms/health
Authorization: Bearer {{secret}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. PROPERTIES  (pesan-pms pattern: multi-property per tenant)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1.1 Create property — expect 201 + property.id
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "name": "Sunset Villa",
  "address": "123 Beach Road, Hurghada",
  "checkInTime": "15:00",
  "checkOutTime": "11:00",
  "minNights": 2,
  "cleaningEnabled": true
}

### 1.2 List properties — expect array containing "Sunset Villa"
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 1.3 Get single property
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 1.4 Property audit (RentTools pattern) — expect findings array
# Expect info finding: feedSlug not set, no channels configured
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}/audit
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 1.5 IDOR: other tenant cannot see this property — expect 404
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{otherTenantId}}

### 1.6 Update property
PATCH {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "minNights": 3,
  "bookingWindow": 180
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. ROOMS  (pesan-pms: room management with status lifecycle)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2.1 Create room — expect 201 + room.id
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "name": "Ocean Suite 101",
  "type": "suite",
  "capacity": 2,
  "rateCents": 15000,
  "floor": 1
}

### 2.2 IDOR: create room with propertyId from other tenant — expect 404
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{otherTenantId}}

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "name": "Stolen Room",
  "type": "standard",
  "capacity": 1,
  "rateCents": 5000
}

### 2.3 List rooms by property — expect rooms array
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/rooms?propertyId={{propertyId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 2.4 Room status should be "available" by default
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

