  "visaTo": "2024-12-01"
}

### 3.2 Search guests by name — expect results containing "Ahmed"
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/guests?search=Ahmed
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 3.3 Search — other tenant sees no results for same query
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/guests?search=Ahmed
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{otherTenantId}}

