# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. BOOKINGS  (full lifecycle: create → check-in → check-out)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4.1 Create booking — expect 201 + bookingStatus: "confirmed"
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "guestId": "{{guestId}}",
  "checkIn": "2024-09-01",
  "checkOut": "2024-09-07",
  "totalAmountCents": 90000,
  "platform": "airbnb",
  "adults": 2,
  "children": 0
}

### 4.2 IDOR: create booking with foreign propertyId — expect 404
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{otherTenantId}}

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "guestId": "{{guestId}}",
  "checkIn": "2024-09-01",
  "checkOut": "2024-09-07",
  "totalAmountCents": 0,
  "platform": "direct"
}

### 4.3 List bookings — expect array with our booking
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/bookings
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 4.4 Filter by status — confirmed only
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/bookings?status=confirmed
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 4.5 Invalid status is silently ignored (returns all)
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/bookings?status=INVALID_STATUS_INJECTION
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 4.6 Check-in — expect bookingStatus: "checked_in", room status: "occupied"
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/check-in
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{}

### 4.7 Verify room is now "occupied"
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 4.8 Check-out — atomic transaction: booking→checked_out, room→cleaning, cleaning task auto-created
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/check-out
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{}

### 4.9 Verify room is now "cleaning"
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 4.10 Verify auto-created cleaning task exists for today
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/cleaning/tasks
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 4.11 Checkout again (already checked_out) — should not error, booking scoped to tenant
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/check-out
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{}

### 4.12 Create second booking for cancel test
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
