# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 6. ICAL CHANNELS  (RentTools: iCal import/export with buffer days)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6.1 Create iCal channel with SSRF-safe test URL — expect 201 + exportToken
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "platform": "airbnb",
  "importUrl": "https://www.airbnb.com/calendar/ical/12345.ics?s=abc",
  "bufferBefore": 1,
  "bufferAfter": 1,
  "enabled": true
}

### 6.2 SSRF protection: reject private IP in importUrl — expect 400/422
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "platform": "other",
  "importUrl": "http://192.168.1.1/internal",
  "bufferBefore": 0,
  "bufferAfter": 0
}

### 6.3 SSRF protection: reject localhost — expect 400/422
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/channels/validate-url
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "url": "http://localhost:8080/admin"
}

### 6.4 Validate safe external URL
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/channels/validate-url
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "url": "https://www.airbnb.com/calendar/ical/test.ics"
}

### 6.5 List channels — expect the created channel
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/channels?propertyId={{propertyId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 6.6 Manual sync trigger — expect { synced: true } or { error }
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/channels/sync
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "channelId": "{{channelId}}"
}

### 6.7 Get sync logs — expect logs array, max 200
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/channels/logs
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 6.8 Get alerts (3-strike failures) — expect empty or alerts array
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/channels/alerts
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 6.9 Platform presets (RentTools RT-17.1) — expect 13 platforms
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/channels/platform-presets
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 6.10 Rotate export token — expect new exportToken
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/channels/{{channelId}}/rotate-token
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{}

### 6.11 iCal export feed (PUBLIC — no auth) — expect text/calendar
# Replace {{exportToken}} with the token from 6.1 or 6.10 response
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/ical/{{exportToken}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 7. CALENDAR EVENTS  (synced OTA events — range cap enforced)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7.1 List calendar events — default range
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/calendar/events?propertyId={{propertyId}}&from=2024-07-01
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 7.2 With explicit to — 730-day cap applies on backend
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/calendar/events?from=2024-01-01&to=2025-01-01
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 7.3 Attempt unbounded query (no to) — backend caps at from+730
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/calendar/events?from=2024-01-01
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 8. DATE OVERRIDES  (pesan-pms: per-property pricing/availability overrides)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 8.1 Create date override (close dates) — expect 201
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/date-overrides
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "date": "2024-12-25",
  "type": "closed",
  "note": "Christmas — closed"
}

### 8.2 Upsert — same date should update, not duplicate
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/date-overrides
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "date": "2024-12-25",
  "type": "open",
  "rateCents": 30000,
  "minNights": 5,
  "note": "Christmas — now open at premium rate"
}

### 8.3 List overrides — expect single entry for 2024-12-25 (upserted)
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/date-overrides?propertyId={{propertyId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

