# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 12. MESSAGE TEMPLATES  (storage layer — trigger/channel/offset fields)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 12.1 Create pre-arrival email template — expect 201
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/message-templates
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "name": "Pre-arrival welcome",
  "channel": "email",
  "trigger": "pre_arrival",
  "sendOffsetDays": -3,
  "subject": "Your stay at Sunset Villa is coming up!",
  "body": "Hi {{guest_name}}, we look forward to welcoming you on {{check_in_date}}. Your pre-arrival form: {{form_link}}"
}

### 12.2 Create check-out follow-up template
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/message-templates
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "name": "Post-stay review request",
  "channel": "email",
  "trigger": "post_stay",
  "sendOffsetDays": 1,
  "subject": "How was your stay?",
  "body": "Dear {{guest_name}}, thank you for staying with us. Please leave a review!"
}

### 12.3 List templates — expect both
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/message-templates
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 12.4 Update template — change sendOffsetDays
PATCH {{pmsUrl}}/api/message-templates/{{templateId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "sendOffsetDays": -5
}

### 12.5 Delete template
DELETE {{pmsUrl}}/api/message-templates/{{templateId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 13. GUEST FORMS  (pesan-pms + RentTools: pre-arrival form end-to-end)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 13.1 Create form template with field definitions — expect 201
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/guest-forms
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "name": "Pre-arrival form",
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "fields": "[{\"id\":\"full_name\",\"type\":\"text\",\"label\":\"Full name\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"nationality\",\"type\":\"text\",\"label\":\"Nationality\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"passport_no\",\"type\":\"text\",\"label\":\"Passport number\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"arrival_time\",\"type\":\"text\",\"label\":\"Estimated arrival time\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"special_requests\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"label\":\"Special requests\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"terms\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"label\":\"I agree to the house rules\",\"required\":true}]"
}

### 13.2 List templates — expect the template
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/guest-forms
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 13.3 Booking lookup — before share token generated
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/guest-forms/booking/{{bookingId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 13.4 Generate share token — expect shareToken in response
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/guest-forms/booking/{{bookingId}}/share
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{}

### 13.5 Generate share token again (idempotent) — same token returned
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/guest-forms/booking/{{bookingId}}/share
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

{}

### 13.6 PUBLIC: Guest loads the form — no auth headers
# shareToken from response 13.4
GET {{pmsUrl}}/public/g/{{shareToken}}

### 13.7 PUBLIC: Guest submits form — expect { ok: true }
POST {{pmsUrl}}/public/g/{{shareToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "full_name": "Ahmed Hassan",
    "nationality": "Egyptian",
    "passport_no": "A12345678",
    "arrival_time": "15:00",
    "special_requests": "Extra towels please",
    "terms": "true"
  }
}

### 13.8 PUBLIC: Submit again — expect 409 already_submitted
POST {{pmsUrl}}/public/g/{{shareToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "full_name": "Ahmed Hassan",
    "nationality": "Egyptian",
    "passport_no": "A12345678",
    "terms": "true"
  }
}

### 13.9 PUBLIC: Missing required field — expect 400 with field name
POST {{pmsUrl}}/public/g/{{shareToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "full_name": "Partial Submit"
  }
}

### 13.10 Dashboard: View submission with answers
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/guest-forms/booking/{{bookingId}}
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 13.11 IDOR: other tenant cannot use this share token for share generation
POST {{pmsUrl}}/api/guest-forms/booking/{{bookingId}}/share
Content-Type: application/json
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{otherTenantId}}

{}

### 13.12 Token too short — expect 400 invalid_token
GET {{pmsUrl}}/public/g/short

