### 14.1 Run property audit — expects findings array
# After all the above: expect "info" findings (low failure count, no overlaps)
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}/audit
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 15. END-TO-END VIA CONTROL API  (verify the 3-hop tenant routing works)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 15.1 Properties via control API (tenant ID in query param → forwarded as header)
GET {{apiUrl}}/pms/api/properties?tenantId={{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secret}}

### 15.2 Bookings via control API
GET {{apiUrl}}/pms/api/bookings?tenantId={{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secret}}

### 15.3 Guest form templates via control API
GET {{apiUrl}}/pms/api/guest-forms?tenantId={{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secret}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 16. EDGE CASES & SECURITY
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 16.1 No auth headers — expect 401
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties

### 16.2 Wrong internal secret — expect 401
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties
x-stockix-internal-secret: wrong-secret
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 16.3 Valid secret but missing tenant header — expect 401
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}

### 16.4 Non-UUID tenant ID — expect 401 (UUID validation fails)
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/properties
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: not-a-uuid

### 16.5 SQL injection attempt in search — expect 200 (empty results, not error)
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/guests?search=' OR 1=1 --
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 16.6 Bookings: no_show status filter (missing from UI but backend supports it)
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/bookings?status=no_show
x-stockix-internal-secret: {{secret}}
x-stockix-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}

### 16.7 iCal export with old (rotated) token — expect 404
GET {{pmsUrl}}/api/ical/OLD_TOKEN_BEFORE_ROTATION
